<title>UK: CRICKET-RAIN PREVENTS PLAY IN BRITISH UNIVERSITIES V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RAIN PREVENTS PLAY IN BRITISH UNIVERSITIES V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>OXFORD, England 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain has washed out play for the second successive day of the three-day tour match between British Universities and Australia at The Parks on Thursday.</p>
</text>
